      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Active runs resume from SQLite. Mode A sessions reattach by ID and every active run is polled. Anything that cannot be proven moves the run to\nneeds_recovery; nothing is retried while its outcome is uncertain.",
      "originalText": "Active runs resume from SQLite. Mode A sessions reattach by ID and every active run is polled. Anything that cannot be proven moves the run to\nneeds_recovery; nothing is retried while its outcome is uncertain.",
