      "text": "Missing installation permissions, Copilot not assignable in the\nrepository, or no cloud-agent entitlement makes that mode\nCAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE, with its reason. The other mode stays\navailable.\n\nExisting installations must accept the new permissions. Until they\ndo, only reads work.",
